[1] A263135 LATTICE FAMILY (edge-isoperimetry of 2D vertex-transitive graphs)
    triangular A047932 = floor(3n-sqrt(12n-3)) : verified=True
    square     A123663 = 2n-ceil(2 sqrt n)     : verified=True
    honeycomb  A263135(2n) = 3n-ceil(sqrt 3n)  : verified=True
    -> all of form (d/2)N - c*sqrt(N); boundary ~ N^{1/2} => isoperimetric dim D=2

